# 本地评审授权音频：音频仅留在开发机，只提交放置说明
frontend/public/demo-audio-local/*
!frontend/public/demo-audio-local/README.md
!frontend/public/demo-audio-local/README.txt
.env.local
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.wav
*.flac
*.aac
*.qmc
*.qmcflac
*.mflac
*.qmc0
*.qmc3
